WEBVTT

00:00:03.830 --> 00:00:05.080
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.850
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:07.850 --> 00:00:10.350
Today, an ally of justice will make her appearance!

00:00:10.350 --> 00:00:12.470
Huh? What about Amu-chan?

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.070
She might actually be in danger of being replaced.

00:00:15.070 --> 00:00:18.450
If that happened, I wonder what would become of us.

00:00:20.690 --> 00:00:24.590
At a time like this, all we can do is our usual cheer.

00:00:24.590 --> 00:00:25.690
Ready, set...

00:00:25.690 --> 00:00:27.020
Doki!

00:00:30.460 --> 00:00:31.530
Yes! Yes!

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:34.400
Let's go!

00:00:36.380 --> 00:00:37.520
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:42.910 --> 00:00:45.280
Shugo, shugo! Yes!

00:00:46.060 --> 00:00:48.850
Swing your arms! Hop, step, jump!

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:53.440
Now start marching straight ahead!

00:00:54.840 --> 00:00:57.110
Way too awesome! Yes!

00:00:57.870 --> 00:01:00.770
Every dream I've ever had!

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:06.680
Since they're all actually coming true.

00:01:06.680 --> 00:01:12.670
What kind of person will I be today?

00:01:12.670 --> 00:01:17.730
What counts is being true to yourself!

00:01:18.470 --> 00:01:21.610
Going somewhere?

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:24.010
Take it to the finish!

00:01:24.010 --> 00:01:27.510
You'll always be able to

00:01:27.510 --> 00:01:30.390
unlock your heart.

00:01:30.390 --> 00:01:33.340
So keep on changing!

00:01:33.340 --> 00:01:35.680
It's so exciting!

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:43.890
Let's go forward, believing in our hearts!

00:01:44.150 --> 00:01:46.950
Straight ahead!

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:48.890
Yeah! Yeah!

00:02:00.220 --> 00:02:01.290
Hello!

00:02:01.290 --> 00:02:02.650
It's morning!

00:02:03.320 --> 00:02:05.760
He just won't wake up, will he?

00:02:05.760 --> 00:02:09.980
And he's using <i>my</i> bed. How oblivious can you get?

00:02:09.980 --> 00:02:12.880
Ikuto still isn't feeling well-nya!

00:02:13.970 --> 00:02:15.890
That's no excuse...

00:02:15.890 --> 00:02:20.130
Amu-chan, you'd best hurry or you'll be late for the start of the new term!

00:02:20.130 --> 00:02:21.560
Wate!

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:23.030
Coming!

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:27.880
Like I said, do <i>not</i> leave this room. Is that clear?

00:02:27.880 --> 00:02:29.350
Crystal-nya!

00:02:29.350 --> 00:02:34.650
Episode 66
Uproar! A Cat-Eared Girl!?

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.910
Amu-chan! Earth to Amu-chan!

00:02:46.690 --> 00:02:48.710
Hinamori-san, what's the matter?

00:02:48.710 --> 00:02:50.150
Uh...

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:51.730
Have you been staying up late?

00:02:51.730 --> 00:02:54.890
I know! She was up all night reading manga!

00:02:54.890 --> 00:02:56.200
Wasn't that <i>you?</i>

00:02:56.200 --> 00:02:58.270
Huh? How'd you know?

00:02:58.270 --> 00:03:02.240
I can't tell Tadase-kun that I didn't get any sleep because of Ikuto!

00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:06.070
Um, well... What were we talking about again?

00:03:06.070 --> 00:03:09.970
We were discussing this cat-eared character that's been seen around town lately.

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:11.580
Cat-eared?

00:03:11.580 --> 00:03:12.770
It couldn't be Ikuto...

00:03:12.770 --> 00:03:16.770
I just heard about it in class. They showed up yesterday.

00:03:17.020 --> 00:03:20.940
Yesterday? But I'm sure he didn't leave the house...

00:03:21.500 --> 00:03:23.780
We still don't know the details,

00:03:23.780 --> 00:03:28.730
but we definitely have reports of this cat-eared girl making a scene wherever she goes.

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:32.360
Oh, so it's a girl.

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:36.080
Speaking of which, Tsukiyomi Ikuto has cat ears, doesn't he?

00:03:36.080 --> 00:03:37.110
Doki!

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:41.550
Perhaps this girl is connected to Easter in some way.

00:03:41.550 --> 00:03:43.940
As Guardians, we must remain watchful.

00:03:43.940 --> 00:03:45.190
Roger!

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:46.730
Yeah.

00:03:50.470 --> 00:03:53.530
That red bean sandwich was so super yummy, and...

00:03:53.530 --> 00:03:55.350
You're acting rather suspiciously.

00:03:56.140 --> 00:03:59.250
Are you lot hiding something?

00:03:59.250 --> 00:04:00.750
What are you talking about?

00:04:00.750 --> 00:04:03.260
We're not hiding a thing.

00:04:05.090 --> 00:04:08.190
Mom's working, so there won't be anyone at home.

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:10.510
I don't think he'll be discovered, but...

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:15.560
It sucks worrying about Ikuto even when I'm at school.

00:04:15.560 --> 00:04:16.610
And then, and then!

00:04:16.610 --> 00:04:18.570
You, there!

00:04:18.570 --> 00:04:22.430
You can't gang up and bully someone like that!

00:04:26.890 --> 00:04:29.200
As long as evil runs rampant throughout this world,

00:04:29.200 --> 00:04:33.310
pretty transforming heroine Cat's Ear will mete out justice-nyan! {I think the "pretty" is important to mimic the sailor moon thing}

00:04:34.970 --> 00:04:36.370
Cat's Ear?

00:04:36.370 --> 00:04:37.570
Nyan?

00:04:38.740 --> 00:04:41.490
Now, apologize to this kid at once-nyan!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:45.680
Wow! It's pretty transforming heroine Cat's Ear!

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.680
Maybe I can get her autograph!

00:04:47.680 --> 00:04:51.870
You, too. Quit crying and say something to the kid who was bullying you-nyan.

00:04:51.870 --> 00:04:54.190
I wasn't being bullied.

00:04:55.180 --> 00:04:57.420
Why were you crying, then?

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:01.670
He fell over and it made him cry. I just asked if he was okay.

00:05:01.670 --> 00:05:03.180
Is that what happened-nyan?

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:06.890
Cat's Ear is scary!

00:05:07.100 --> 00:05:08.080
Let's go.

00:05:08.080 --> 00:05:09.700
Are you okay?

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:11.460
Wait! I'm not scary-nyan!

00:05:11.460 --> 00:05:13.360
Cat's Ear is an ally of just—

00:05:15.450 --> 00:05:17.210
Ow, ow, ow...

00:05:17.210 --> 00:05:19.350
Nuts, it came off again.

00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:21.620
A copycat, huh? {Copycat, fnarr fnarr. Quark, feel free to change this to phony if you like, but the thought of working "copycat" like she's imitating a real cat-eared heroine, made me giggle a bit}

00:05:21.620 --> 00:05:25.290
Is she the cause of all the rumors?

00:05:25.290 --> 00:05:28.010
She just likes to stick her nose where it doesn't belong.

00:05:28.490 --> 00:05:31.840
In any case, I doubt she has any connection to Easter.

00:05:31.840 --> 00:05:33.500
Let's go home.

00:05:36.230 --> 00:05:37.830
See ya, Amu-chi!

00:05:37.830 --> 00:05:39.570
Yeah, see you tomorrow!

00:05:43.930 --> 00:05:45.470
What is it, Amu-chan?

00:05:47.870 --> 00:05:48.970
Hi.

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:53.140
An ally of justice must not carelessly reveal herself!

00:05:53.140 --> 00:05:56.470
Uh, you stood out plenty a second ago...

00:05:56.470 --> 00:05:59.130
Amu-chan's just as nosy, don't you think?

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:03.210
That's how she ended up with Ikuto stuck in her room.

00:06:03.210 --> 00:06:07.540
But it's another reason why Amu-chan is oh-so-wonderful.

00:06:07.540 --> 00:06:09.310
What's your name?

00:06:09.310 --> 00:06:10.970
I'm Hinamori Amu.

00:06:10.970 --> 00:06:13.640
I'm Nakayama Chiyoko.

00:06:13.640 --> 00:06:15.430
But you can call me Choco-tan.

00:06:15.430 --> 00:06:17.580
Ch–Choco-tan?

00:06:17.580 --> 00:06:21.220
To be honest, my mom and dad are both huge anime fans.

00:06:21.220 --> 00:06:25.370
On that fateful day when they first met, they were at a "Magical Choco-tan" anime event!

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:31.190
They even named me Chiyoko after the main character, Choco-tan!

00:06:31.190 --> 00:06:35.340
Ah, it's super romantic! But I really shouldn't be telling you this!

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:37.640
I–I see...

00:06:37.640 --> 00:06:39.580
So, anyway, Chiyo—

00:06:38.670 --> 00:06:39.800
Choco-tan!

00:06:40.360 --> 00:06:43.830
R–Right, Choco-tan. Why are you dressed like that?

00:06:44.300 --> 00:06:45.720
That's a good question.

00:06:45.720 --> 00:06:48.270
It's what any normal person would want to know.

00:06:48.270 --> 00:06:49.830
How should I put this...

00:06:49.830 --> 00:06:56.300
My ideal character is a clumsy girl you just can't hate, who's all like, "I can't help it!"

00:06:56.300 --> 00:07:00.420
When all the while, she's transforming into pretty heroine Cat's Ear! Someone like that!

00:07:00.420 --> 00:07:01.490
Say what?

00:07:01.490 --> 00:07:06.430
And while establishing herself as a pretty transforming heroine, she battles evil across the globe...

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:11.290
But even if our heroine only manages to save a few people, she's beloved by the citizens,

00:07:11.290 --> 00:07:14.730
and captures the hearts of fans everywhere with ease!

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:18.480
I'd give anything to be popular like that!

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:21.100
She is completely and utterly clueless.

00:07:21.100 --> 00:07:23.710
At least she's enjoying herself.

00:07:23.710 --> 00:07:28.130
Basically, you're dressing up as your role model and trying to save people?

00:07:28.130 --> 00:07:29.730
Exactly!

00:07:29.730 --> 00:07:33.890
When I transform into Cat's Ear, I feel like I can do anything!

00:07:33.890 --> 00:07:39.480
But when I'm not transformed I'm just a shy, useless girl.

00:07:39.950 --> 00:07:41.900
No one ever pays any attention to me.

00:07:41.900 --> 00:07:44.910
And that's exactly why I transform into Cat's Ear!

00:07:44.910 --> 00:07:49.230
But is it possible to live my life transformed like this?

00:07:49.230 --> 00:07:51.520
She seems kind of preoccupied.

00:07:52.100 --> 00:07:54.720
That Hinamori Amu's here again.

00:07:54.720 --> 00:07:58.770
Oh well. That Choco-tan girly's pretty darn lost there.

00:07:59.860 --> 00:08:02.410
She might be a good choice for my next target.

00:08:11.770 --> 00:08:13.740
Ikuto, are you awake?

00:08:14.170 --> 00:08:15.700
I'm hungry.

00:08:16.420 --> 00:08:18.640
That's what got you up-nya?

00:08:18.640 --> 00:08:22.040
Though now that you mention it, I'm pretty hungry, too-nya.

00:08:23.230 --> 00:08:28.880
No problem. Everyone's gone, so it's the perfect time to swipe some grub-nya!

00:08:28.880 --> 00:08:31.000
Try not to get sidetracked.

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:33.760
I ain't gonna get sidetracked! Trust me-nya!

00:08:40.960 --> 00:08:43.370
Everything's A-OK...

00:08:45.830 --> 00:08:47.630
A ball of yarn-nya!

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.090
I–I–I–I can't!

00:08:49.090 --> 00:08:50.920
This is no time to be playing around-nya.

00:08:50.920 --> 00:08:54.270
I gotta get some food before people come home.

00:08:54.510 --> 00:08:59.480
But that soft and fluffy-wuffy feeling...

00:08:59.480 --> 00:09:02.390
I'll just touch it a little teensy...

00:09:04.900 --> 00:09:06.090
He's slow.

00:09:11.930 --> 00:09:14.740
Ikuto, I can't move-nya!

00:09:15.230 --> 00:09:16.350
Dude...

00:09:16.730 --> 00:09:19.430
Ikuto and Yoru must be hungry.

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:22.510
Man, they're such a pain to take care of.

00:09:23.080 --> 00:09:24.270
I'm ho...

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.140
Something's not right.

00:09:29.800 --> 00:09:32.080
I'm just getting more tangled-nya.

00:09:32.080 --> 00:09:33.680
I told you to stop moving around.

00:09:33.680 --> 00:09:36.460
This is your fault-nya!

00:09:36.460 --> 00:09:38.270
Now, just a second...

00:09:39.760 --> 00:09:42.900
What the heck are you two playing around for?

00:09:42.900 --> 00:09:44.010
Crap.

00:09:44.010 --> 00:09:47.310
Didn't I tell you not to leave my room?!

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:54.660
You're hungry, right?

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:56.330
Pass these on to Ikuto.

00:09:56.330 --> 00:09:57.350
Pass these on.

00:09:57.350 --> 00:09:58.300
Pass these on.

00:09:58.300 --> 00:10:00.530
Please pass these on.

00:10:00.530 --> 00:10:02.500
Taiyaki-nya!

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.100
It's empty.

00:10:07.100 --> 00:10:08.390
Say what-nya?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.040
Give us more-nya!

00:10:10.040 --> 00:10:11.900
Yeah.

00:10:11.900 --> 00:10:13.520
But...

00:10:13.520 --> 00:10:14.890
But...

00:10:15.430 --> 00:10:17.800
Why are you guys eating them?

00:10:17.800 --> 00:10:21.500
So you and Ikuto can have a nice heart-to-heart talk.

00:10:21.500 --> 00:10:23.000
Why would I do that?

00:10:23.000 --> 00:10:27.250
It's not like I was worried about him the whole time here <i>and</i> at school or anything.

00:10:27.250 --> 00:10:31.770
Oh? Were you thinking about me all day long?

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:33.360
Sure sounds like love.

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:34.400
You jerk!

00:10:34.400 --> 00:10:37.900
I couldn't tell Tadase-kun the truth, so I looked like I was lying my face off!

00:10:37.900 --> 00:10:40.610
You're a real pain in the butt!

00:10:40.610 --> 00:10:43.230
If you're unhappy, then throw me out for real.

00:10:43.730 --> 00:10:46.670
I'd like nothing more than for you to take off!

00:10:46.670 --> 00:10:48.320
Amu-chan!

00:10:49.980 --> 00:10:54.900
Easy for her to say-nya! We're between a rock and a hard place here! {Non-literal, I know, but I think it fits.}

00:10:58.290 --> 00:11:00.110
Stop right there-nyan!

00:11:00.110 --> 00:11:05.700
As long as evil runs rampant throughout this world, pretty transforming heroine Cat's Ear

00:11:05.700 --> 00:11:07.730
will mete out justice-nyan!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:10.230
Cat's Ear! How dare you!

00:11:10.230 --> 00:11:13.620
Cat's Ear Supersonic Wave!

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:17.850
Cat's Ear is stwong!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:21.170
I do it, too! Cat's Ear Supahsonic Wave!

00:11:26.030 --> 00:11:29.060
I wonder if I went too far back there.

00:11:30.030 --> 00:11:33.080
No. He's definitely a pain.

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:36.880
I'm heading out.

00:11:36.880 --> 00:11:39.290
Are you okay, Amu-chan?

00:11:39.290 --> 00:11:42.890
Man, I didn't sleep a wink again.

00:11:42.300 --> 00:11:46.380
If you get hungry, eat these.

00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.300
Stupid Ikuto...

00:11:56.930 --> 00:11:57.820
See you later!

00:11:57.820 --> 00:11:59.590
Yeah, until tomorrow!

00:12:04.990 --> 00:12:08.350
Spraying graffiti in a place like this? How dare he!

00:12:09.450 --> 00:12:10.870
Man, I want to tell him a thing or two!

00:12:10.870 --> 00:12:14.260
But I'm just a shy and useless girl.

00:12:14.260 --> 00:12:16.770
Yep, I definitely have to transform!

00:12:19.680 --> 00:12:22.190
And lastly, the cat-ears...

00:12:24.320 --> 00:12:27.890
Hey, I heard a fantastic new crepe place has opened up!

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:30.250
You guys wanna come try it out with me?

00:12:30.250 --> 00:12:33.140
Crepes, huh? Are you interested, Hinamori-san?

00:12:33.390 --> 00:12:35.600
Um, I...

00:12:36.070 --> 00:12:39.600
What should I do? I have to get home to feed Ikuto.

00:12:39.600 --> 00:12:40.310
Feed?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:42.490
Someone said that cat-eared person showed up again!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:43.940
Let's check it out!

00:12:44.390 --> 00:12:45.850
Is it that girl again?

00:12:45.850 --> 00:12:48.630
I have no interest in some phony Cat's Ear!

00:12:49.050 --> 00:12:50.650
Think it's Choco-tan?

00:12:50.650 --> 00:12:53.590
There's a chance it could be Ikuto!

00:12:54.960 --> 00:12:56.790
I'll go see if it's her.

00:12:57.200 --> 00:12:58.430
Amu?

00:13:00.280 --> 00:13:03.250
Where could Ikuto-kun be hiding?

00:13:03.250 --> 00:13:06.070
I've searched everywhere, but I still haven't found him.

00:13:06.070 --> 00:13:07.260
I heard it's over there!

00:13:07.260 --> 00:13:09.130
Cat ears, cat ears!

00:13:09.930 --> 00:13:11.020
Cat ears?

00:13:15.880 --> 00:13:17.140
Uh, who the heck are you?

00:13:17.340 --> 00:13:20.420
You can't go spraying graffiti all over the place-nyan!

00:13:20.420 --> 00:13:25.070
Pretty transforming heroine Cat's Ear will make you clean up your act-nyan!

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:28.760
Well, rats, it's not Ikuto-kun.

00:13:28.760 --> 00:13:31.220
She's really got cat ears!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.960
It's not Ikuto!

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:33.660
Yeah.

00:13:33.660 --> 00:13:34.820
But...

00:13:38.450 --> 00:13:41.670
Hey, you! What do you think you're doing to the Master's greatest work?!

00:13:41.670 --> 00:13:42.640
Master?

00:13:42.900 --> 00:13:45.460
This man is a famous artist!

00:13:45.460 --> 00:13:50.420
You've completely ruined our filming of his street performance!

00:13:51.540 --> 00:13:53.760
I–I'm sorry!

00:13:53.760 --> 00:13:55.970
She calls herself an ally of justice...

00:13:55.970 --> 00:13:57.730
But she just causes problems.

00:13:58.950 --> 00:14:01.160
Master, are you okay?

00:14:11.500 --> 00:14:15.190
Maybe I really am just a useless girl.

00:14:15.190 --> 00:14:17.180
You're lost, aren't you?

00:14:17.570 --> 00:14:21.830
There's no need to worry, you're a spectacular transforming heroine.

00:14:21.830 --> 00:14:26.250
I do not know who you are, however I thank you for your kind words.

00:14:27.010 --> 00:14:29.190
I think, though, I have come to realize

00:14:29.190 --> 00:14:33.870
that I might've been meddling in other people's affairs a little.

00:14:33.870 --> 00:14:37.540
A little? It's totally obvious she was meddling.

00:14:37.540 --> 00:14:42.680
If I was the star of an anime, I could be cool and actually help people, though.

00:14:42.680 --> 00:14:44.020
In that case...

00:14:45.550 --> 00:14:49.010
You should be as helpful as you'd like!

00:14:49.010 --> 00:14:50.230
Huh?

00:14:50.230 --> 00:14:53.940
With this jewelry, your wish will come true.

00:15:01.970 --> 00:15:06.270
Just do what y'all wanna do!

00:15:06.490 --> 00:15:09.570
? Character Change!

00:15:10.380 --> 00:15:12.300
Amu-chan, we have to hurry!

00:15:12.300 --> 00:15:13.060
Right!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.270
It's like power is welling up inside of me!

00:15:16.270 --> 00:15:19.970
I feel like I can do anything now!

00:15:24.390 --> 00:15:26.820
Get to it, y'all!

00:15:28.630 --> 00:15:33.140
Character Transformation: Pretty Transforming Heroine Magical Choco-tan Dream! {lol, adding the "pretty" just makes this even more ridiculous. I like it.}

00:15:33.140 --> 00:15:36.090
Full Power!

00:15:37.440 --> 00:15:40.250
Now, get out there and help everyone!

00:15:41.630 --> 00:15:44.140
I must complete my work at all costs!

00:15:44.140 --> 00:15:46.580
The Master never fails to impress!

00:15:46.580 --> 00:15:50.060
You again? I won't let you interfere like last ti—

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.430
Never fear-nyan!

00:15:52.430 --> 00:15:55.140
I'll make it even more beautiful-nyan!

00:15:57.910 --> 00:15:59.560
Complete!

00:16:00.680 --> 00:16:02.420
My... My art...

00:16:06.390 --> 00:16:09.490
Playing around at being a giant monster just won't cut it.

00:16:09.490 --> 00:16:12.140
I'll help you guys kick it up a notch!

00:16:17.880 --> 00:16:19.460
Wild...

00:16:20.420 --> 00:16:22.480
But we're outta here!

00:16:22.980 --> 00:16:25.990
I want to do good! I want to be popular!

00:16:25.990 --> 00:16:28.520
Could this be killing two birds with one stone?

00:16:28.520 --> 00:16:30.270
Everyone, look!

00:16:30.270 --> 00:16:35.120
I'm pretty transforming heroine Magical Choco-tan Dream!

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:36.820
Stop this, Choco-tan!

00:16:36.820 --> 00:16:38.980
I won't let you get in my way!

00:16:38.980 --> 00:16:40.570
Holy Crown!

00:16:43.940 --> 00:16:45.020
Tadase-kun.

00:16:45.020 --> 00:16:46.720
Are you okay, Amu?

00:16:46.720 --> 00:16:50.020
No fair, Amu-chi! Were you going to deal with this all by yourself?

00:16:50.070 --> 00:16:51.520
Guys!

00:16:51.520 --> 00:16:52.650
Amu-chan!

00:16:52.650 --> 00:16:53.530
Right.

00:16:55.930 --> 00:16:57.150
My heart:

00:16:57.150 --> 00:16:58.460
My heart:

00:16:58.460 --> 00:16:59.690
My heart:

00:16:59.690 --> 00:17:01.370
My heart:

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.940
Unlock!

00:17:28.850 --> 00:17:31.480
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:17:33.070 --> 00:17:36.100
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:17:37.270 --> 00:17:39.890
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:44.130
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:17:48.600 --> 00:17:52.730
The heroine is in a crisis, and all her friends along with her!

00:17:52.730 --> 00:17:54.530
The foreshadowed event has come to pass!

00:17:54.530 --> 00:17:57.400
From now on, it's the real deal!

00:17:57.400 --> 00:17:59.680
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:08.440
Juggling Party!

00:18:14.200 --> 00:18:16.050
Now, it's my turn!

00:18:17.560 --> 00:18:22.890
Cat's Ear Supersonic Wave! Pretty Transforming Heroine Magical Choco-tan Special!

00:18:22.890 --> 00:18:24.850
Your attack name is too long.

00:18:33.000 --> 00:18:36.770
Spiral Heart Special!

00:18:37.270 --> 00:18:40.750
Magical Choco-tan Dream Special!

00:18:45.150 --> 00:18:48.970
This is no mere cosplay, my power is real!

00:18:49.550 --> 00:18:52.930
Choco-tan's fall to the dark side is complete. {Okay, I know this isn't literal, and it sounds so cute to hear Su say it. But I suggest as an alternative: "Choco-tan's transformation to the villain is complete." or "Choco-tan has become the villain."}

00:18:52.930 --> 00:18:56.360
You're always like this! You don't see what's going on around you!

00:18:57.150 --> 00:18:58.790
What are you talking about?

00:18:58.790 --> 00:18:59.430
I'm...

00:18:59.630 --> 00:19:02.690
To put it bluntly, you're just a big pest!

00:19:02.690 --> 00:19:06.260
There's no way I could look up to someone like you!

00:19:06.260 --> 00:19:08.210
You fail as a transforming heroine!

00:19:09.560 --> 00:19:14.950
It seemed like you really enjoyed talking about anime, though.

00:19:14.950 --> 00:19:17.120
Isn't cosplaying enough?

00:19:17.120 --> 00:19:21.580
When you try to be someone else, maybe it feels like you're only acting like who you admire.

00:19:21.990 --> 00:19:25.890
But that's wrong. When you do that, it's not just role playing...

00:19:25.890 --> 00:19:28.560
You're waking the potential sleeping inside you.

00:19:30.230 --> 00:19:31.520
That's right!

00:19:31.520 --> 00:19:35.540
I totally understand wanting to take a step forward!

00:19:35.540 --> 00:19:40.040
But don't force it. Keep working at being the person you admire, and you'll get there.

00:19:40.040 --> 00:19:43.540
You should fix your meddlesome, reckless ways first.

00:19:43.540 --> 00:19:46.850
You're a wonderful cosplayer, though, Choco-tan!

00:19:50.680 --> 00:19:52.050
Lulu, look!

00:19:54.750 --> 00:19:56.140
The Embryo!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:57.540
Nana!

00:19:57.540 --> 00:19:59.200
Just leave that there Embryo to me!

00:19:59.990 --> 00:20:02.450
You're going to catch it with that?

00:20:02.450 --> 00:20:03.550
Amu-chan!

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:04.860
Finish it!

00:20:06.360 --> 00:20:09.140
Negative Heart: Lock On!

00:20:12.520 --> 00:20:14.710
Open Heart!

00:20:40.550 --> 00:20:41.720
Was I dreaming?

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.320
I'll remember this, y'hear!

00:20:58.310 --> 00:21:01.490
Huh? What was I...

00:21:03.150 --> 00:21:04.590
See, I wasn't kidding.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:07.370
Wow, it's Cat's Ear!

00:21:07.370 --> 00:21:08.600
Cool!

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:13.910
Nyan!

00:21:13.910 --> 00:21:15.140
Nyan!

00:21:20.900 --> 00:21:23.750
I kind of spoke down to Choco-tan back there.

00:21:23.750 --> 00:21:26.790
I'm the one who doesn't see what's going on around her.

00:21:26.790 --> 00:21:28.350
What brought this on?

00:21:28.350 --> 00:21:30.250
What are you talking about?

00:21:30.250 --> 00:21:34.660
Ikuto didn't have anyone else to rely on. That's why he came to my place.

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:39.160
He might say mean things, but I bet it's all an act.

00:21:39.590 --> 00:21:42.560
And yet, I said some pretty awful things to him.

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.220
I'm home!

00:21:47.220 --> 00:21:49.610
Welcome home, Sis!

00:21:54.170 --> 00:21:56.770
I brought crepes for you, Ikuto.

00:22:15.890 --> 00:22:17.280
Ikuto?

00:22:23.500 --> 00:22:24.300
(For real?)

00:22:26.230 --> 00:22:26.600
(Eh?)

00:22:26.600 --> 00:22:29.310
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:29.310 --> 00:22:31.970
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:37.150
If we ended up becoming adults today, {kyou mo}

00:22:37.150 --> 00:22:41.780
I bet we'd lose sight of everything except what's in front of us. {kitto}

00:22:41.780 --> 00:22:42.890
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:43.120 --> 00:22:48.050
So I wonder what we've been {kyoumade}

00:22:48.050 --> 00:22:52.430
so engrossed with finding all this time. {honto}

00:22:52.690 --> 00:22:53.770
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:53.770 --> 00:22:55.680
Someone once said: {dare ga}

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:58.590
"We were born to be happy, {shiawase}

00:22:58.590 --> 00:23:04.850
so let's live to make others happy!" {soshite}

00:23:06.140 --> 00:23:07.330
How long will I have to {dore kurai}

00:23:07.330 --> 00:23:09.030
carry all this love in my heart? {mune ippai}

00:23:09.030 --> 00:23:10.080
How long will I have to {dore kurai}

00:23:10.080 --> 00:23:11.700
carry all this love in my heart? {mune ippai}

00:23:11.700 --> 00:23:17.210
I wonder when I'll be able to let it all out. {kakaetara}

00:23:17.210 --> 00:23:18.210
How many of {dore kurai}

00:23:18.210 --> 00:23:19.860
all those days in my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:19.860 --> 00:23:20.920
How many of{dore kurai}

00:23:20.920 --> 00:23:22.680
all those days in my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:28.090
How many of them have we run through? {ano hi}

00:23:28.090 --> 00:23:29.140
With this much love {kore kurai}

00:23:29.140 --> 00:23:30.830
filling my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:30.830 --> 00:23:31.920
With this much love{kore kurai}

00:23:31.920 --> 00:23:33.500
filling my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:33.500 --> 00:23:36.220
I hugged you tightly, {kimi wo}

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:41.640
and during that time, we both felt so much happiness. {futari}

00:23:41.640 --> 00:23:43.940
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:43.940 --> 00:23:44.440
(Why?)

00:23:44.440 --> 00:23:47.160
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:47.160 --> 00:23:49.710
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:49.710 --> 00:23:51.040
(Phew...)

00:23:51.610 --> 00:23:53.210
Amu-chan, what's the matter?

00:23:53.210 --> 00:23:56.380
Amu-chan is feeling down because Ikuto disappeared.

00:23:56.380 --> 00:23:59.250
No matter what she says, she must be worried.

00:23:59.250 --> 00:24:00.750
Hey, what are you guys up to?

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:04.010
Okay, let's wish for Ikuto to come back!

00:24:04.010 --> 00:24:05.590
Bentora, bentora...

00:24:05.590 --> 00:24:07.010
Space people! {lol! These kids are nuts}

00:24:07.010 --> 00:24:10.960
